('fe032b75-9064-4677-8e55-37c6394b204c', 'Nurofen Express 200 mg, 20 capsules, Reckitt Benckiser', 'Nurofen Express soft capsules quickly soothe headaches, migraines, muscle or rheumatic pains. Pain relief also depends on how easily the medicine is broken down and absorbed in the body. Nurofen Express 200 mg soft capsules are quickly absorbed by the body, targeting the painful area. Due to its composition, Nurofen Express calms quickly and makes its effect promptly and effectively right at the source of the pain. This way you regain your well-being and you can enjoy every moment.
