('bd154714-9758-4e08-bc15-0b44da2ad617', 'Paracetamol, 500 mg, 20 tablets, Zentiva', 'Indications:- Paracetamol Zentiva is part of the group of analgesic-antipyretic drugs (relieves pain and reduces body temperature in case of fever);- Paracetamol Zentiva is indicated in the symptomatic treatment of pain of mild to moderate intensity, with different locations (headaches, sore throat, toothache, pain associated with cold and flu, muscle or joint pain or in case of painful menstruation) and the symptomatic treatment of fever.
