('bceea1c7-3c83-4a37-8370-66f886540255', 'Strepsils honey and lemon, 24 tablets, Reckitt Benckiser', 'Indications: Strepsils Honey and Lemon belongs to a group of drugs called antiseptics. Strepsils Honey and Lemon is used as an adjuvant in the treatment of oropharyngeal infections, favoring the relief of the symptoms caused by them. Rapid (in 5 minutes) and long-lasting (up to 2 hours) relief of sore throat. Antibacterial, antifungal and antiviral effect.
