('5df9a655-5313-46f1-a869-b70595813b0f', 'Strepsils Honey&Lemon x24 tablets, Reckitt Benckiser Healthcare', 'Strepsils Honey and Lemon provide fast and effective relief of sore throats, acting from the first signs of pain. Its formula includes antiseptic ingredients to fight bacterial infections and is enriched with honey and lemon for an emollient effect and a pleasant aroma.', 'Neck pain', 22.0, 'RECKITT BENCKISER', 'https://c.cdnmp.net/767429209/p/l/3/strepsils-miere-lamaie-x24-comprimate-reckitt-benckiser-healthcare~5523.jpg', '2025-01-01', '2027-01-01', FALSE, 'No known side effects', 0, 100);
