('6a125ae4-564f-49c6-8317-21c6520ffc02', 'Coldrex Maxgrip Lemon, 10 sachets, Perrigo', 'Indications: Coldrex Maxgrip Lemon is a cold and flu medicine that contains three active substances: - paracetamol that relieves pain and reduces the temperature when you have a fever; - phenylephrine hydrochloride is a decongestant that unclogs the nose and sinuses and helps you breathe easier; - vitamin C (ascorbic acid) replaces vitamin C that is lost in the first stages of colds and flu.
